## 3. BT_ZombieModeAI 编辑器结构

打开 `BT_ZombieModeAI.uasset`,选择 BB 为 `BB_ZombieModeAI`,按以下结构搭建:

### 3.0 Root 配置 (⚠️ 关键配置)

```
Root (Selector)  ← 在 Details 面板配置以下两项:
├── Service_UpdateZombieState   (挂根, 0.25s 派生身份+人数快照)
├── Service_UpdateZombieTargets (挂根, 0.25s 派生最近目标)
└── Service_UpdateWeaponAmmo    (挂根, 0.10s 派生弹药状态)
```

**⚠️ Service 配置警告 (必读):**
- `Service_UpdateWeaponAmmo` → `MagazineSizeKey` 的 BB Key Selector 必须选 **`MagazineSize`**
  - ❌ 不要选 `MaxMagazineAmmo` (C++ 写入的 Key 名是 `MagazineSize`)
  - 选错 Key 名 → 弹药状态写入错误 Key → 后续 Decorator 永远读到 0 → 人类永不开火
- Root Selector 详情面板 → 勾 **`Restart Tree on Search Abort = true`**
  - 身份切换时立即重启 BT,不等下一 Tick

### 3.1 母体分支 — Sequence "Mother: Chase and Infect"

```
Sequence "Mother: Chase and Infect"
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: bIsMother, Query: Is Set (true)
│
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: NearestHumanTarget, Query: Is Set
│
├── BTTask: Rotate to face BB entry (UE 原生)
│   └── Key: TargetActor
│
├── BTTask: Move To (UE 原生) ★ [v107 新增,勿漏]
│   ├── Key: TargetActor
│   ├── Acceptance Radius: 150 (cm, 贴近就够)
│   └── bObserveTarget: false
│
├── BTTask: PlayAttackMontage (复用 Melee)
│   ├── 执行结果: Succeeded → 走下个 Task WaitMontageFinish
│   └── 异常: 没要到蒙太奇 → 上游 Decorator 拦截 (不卡死)
│
└── BTTask: WaitMontageFinish (复用 Melee)
    ├── Wait Time: 1.00s
    └── Wait Timeout: 3.0s  ← ★ 建议不超过 3s (蒙太奇通常 1-2s)
```

### 3.2 人类最后母体分支 — Sequence "Human: Last Mother Pursuit"

```
Sequence "Human: Last Mother Pursuit"
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: bIsHuman, Query: Is Set (true)
│
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: AliveMotherCount, Query: Numeric Value == 1
│
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition  ★ [v107 新增,勿漏]
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: NearestMotherTarget, Query: Is Set (确保有目标再追)
│
└── SimpleParallel (Finish with main task)
    │
    ├── Main Task:
    │   BTTask: Move To (UE 原生)
    │       ├── Key: TargetActor (= NearestMotherTarget)
    │       ├── Acceptance Radius: 200 (cm)
    │       └── bObserveTarget: true  ← 边走边看,关键
    │
    └── Background Tree: "持续射击子树"
        │
        ├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
        │   └── BB Key: NearestMotherTarget, Query: Is Set  ★ [v107 新增]
        │
        ├── Decorator: CooldownReady (复用 Melee)
        │   └── CooldownEndTimeKey: CooldownEndTime
        │
        ├── Decorator: Zombie Ammo Empty  ★ [必须 Invert]
        │   └── CurrentAmmoKey: CurrentAmmo
        │   └── ⚠️ 右键 → Invert = true (语义: 弹药非空才放行)
        │
        ├── Loop (UE 原生, Infinite)
        │
        ├── BTTask: StartPrimaryFire
        │   └── TargetActorKey: TargetActor
        │
        ├── Wait (UE 原生, Wait Time: 1.00s)  ← 与 ConfigSO.ZombieMoveAndFireBurstSeconds 匹配
        │
        └── BTTask: StopPrimaryFire
```

### 3.3 人类补给分支 — Sequence "Human: Find Ammo Supply"

```
Sequence "Human: Find Ammo Supply"
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: bIsHuman, Query: Is Set (true)
│
├── Decorator: Zombie Ammo Empty
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── CurrentAmmoKey: CurrentAmmo
│   └── ⚠️ 此 Decorator 语义: CurrentAmmo <= 0 → 返回 true → 放行 (弹药空才找补给,无需 Invert)
│
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: bAmmoSupplyAvailable, Query: Is Set (true)
│   └── ⚠️ 当前为 false → 此分支实际不会进入 (补给未开放,属于正常行为)
│
├── BTTask: Move To (UE 原生)
│   └── Key: AmmoSupplyTarget
│
└── BTTask: ReloadPrimaryWeapon (自定义)
    └── 失败: 无武器/满弹药/正在换弹 → 返回 Failed
```

### 3.4 人类守点分支 — Sequence "Human: Rally Guard"

```
Sequence "Human: Rally Guard"
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: bIsHuman, Query: Is Set (true)
│
├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
│   ├── Observer Aborts: Both
│   └── BB Key: bRallyPointLocked, Query: Is Not Set (false)
│   └── ⚠️ bRallyPointLocked == true 时此分支不进入 (已锁点,不走守点分支)
│
├── BTTask: SelectZombieRallyPoint (自定义)
│   └── 选点逻辑: Nearest (最近点) 或 MostPopulated (人类最多点)
│   └── 失败: 无集合点 / NavMesh 不可达 → 返回 Failed (BT 不兜底漫游)
│
└── SimpleParallel (Finish with main task)
    │
    ├── Main Task:
    │   BTTask: Move To (UE 原生)
    │       ├── Key: LockedRallyPoint
    │       ├── Acceptance Radius: 80 (ConfigSO.ZombieRallyArrivalRadius)
    │       └── bObserveTarget: true
    │
    └── Background Tree: "持续观察射击子树"
        │
        ├── Decorator: Blackboard Based Condition
        │   └── BB Key: NearestMotherTarget, Query: Is Set
        │
        ├── Decorator: CooldownReady (复用 Melee)  ★ [v107 新增]
        │   └── CooldownEndTimeKey: CooldownEndTime
        │
        ├── Decorator: Zombie Ammo Empty  ★ [必须 Invert]
        │   ├── CurrentAmmoKey: CurrentAmmo
        │   └── ⚠️ 右键 → Invert = true (语义: 弹药非空才放行开火)
        │
        ├── Loop (UE 原生, Infinite)
        │
        ├── BTTask: StartPrimaryFire
        │   └── TargetActorKey: TargetActor
        │
        ├── Wait (UE 原生, Wait Time: 1.00s)  ← 与 ConfigSO.ZombieMoveAndFireBurstSeconds 匹配
        │
        └── BTTask: StopPrimaryFire
```

