## 4. BP_ZombieAIController 配置

```
1. 在 Content Browser → Content/Blueprints/AI/
2. 右键 → Blueprint Class → 搜索 "ZombieAIController" → 创建 BP_ZombieAIController
3. 打开 BP_ZombieAIController (继承自 AZombieAIController)
4. Class Defaults → 不需要额外配置 (BT 启动继承自 BaseAIController.InitializeFromConfig)
5. Compile + Save
```

---

## 5. BP_ZombieRallyPoint 配置

```
1. Content Browser → Content/Blueprints/Objectives/
2. 右键 → Blueprint Class → 搜索 "ZombieRallyPoint" → 创建 BP_ZombieRallyPoint
3. 打开 BP_ZombieRallyPoint
4. Class Defaults:
   - PointID: "RallyA" (或其他唯一 ID, 必须非空)
   - PopulationRadius: 800 (cm, 人数统计半径)
   - ArrivalRadiusOverride: 0 (用 ConfigSO 默认)
5. Compile + Save
6. 拖 BP_ZombieRallyPoint 到关卡里,放置 3-5 个在防御位置
   每个实例的 PointID 必须唯一 (RallyA / RallyB / RallyC / ...)
```

